PROOF-52.after:
The run writes this operating system's section of `.purlin/evidence/local/<feature-name>.json`. The
section holds:

- the commit of the code it describes, and the time;
- who ran it, and on which machine;
- the fingerprint of the spec, code and tests it saw;
- each rule's word, and each proof's result and test.

It prints `Evidence written to .purlin/evidence/local/<feature-name>.json.`, or the folder and a count

